y purpose other than fulfilling its obligations under the Project.”"},{"choices":[{"meaning":"窗口明示实际生效的类别化披露许可。","name":"operative_permission"},{"meaning":"窗口给出披露禁令并对列明接收者类别形成真实许可例外。","name":"prohibition_with_class_permission"},{"meaning":"窗口只有实际披露禁令，没有列明接收者类别许可。","name":"operative_prohibition_only"},{"meaning":"窗口把人员类别置于保密义务范围，但没有足够许可措辞。","name":"elliptical_recipient_confidentiality_scope"},{"meaning":"窗口不是实际披露规范。","name":"not_an_operative_disclosure_norm"}],"examples":[],"name":"disclosure_effect_v2","question":"判断整个供应窗口的披露规范效力，不把定义、序言或省略文字补成许可。原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“The Confidential Information may be disclosed only to employees or contractors of the Recipient with a “need to know” who are subject to written confidentiality agreements sufficient to carry out the intent of this Agreement.” 原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“(c) not to disclose the same whether to its employees or to third parties except in confidence to such of its employees, directors or contractors who need to know the same for the Purpose and that (i) such employees, directors and contractors are obliged by their contracts of employment or services not to disclose the same, (ii) the receiving party shall enforce such obligations at its expense and at the request of the disclosing party in so far as breach thereof relates to the disclosing party's Confidential Information;”"},{"choices":[{"meaning":"窗口明确覆盖接收方自己的员工或工作人员。","name":"stated"},{"meaning":"完整供应窗口没有明确覆盖接收方自己的员工或工作人员。","name":"not_stated_in_window"}],"examples":[],"name":"recipient_employees_v2","question":"判断供应披露窗口是否明确覆盖接收方自己的员工或工作人员；不得把受控实体员工、承包商或顾问改写为接收方员工。原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“The Confidential Information may be disclosed only to employees or contractors of the Recipient with a “need to know” who are subject to written confidentiality agreements sufficient to carry out the intent of this Agreement.”"},{"choices":[{"meaning":"窗口明确覆盖受控、控制或共同控制实体的员工。","name":"stated"},{"meaning":"完整供应窗口没有明确覆盖此类实体员工。","name":"not_stated_in_window"}],"examples":[],"name":"controlled_entity_employees_v2","question":"判断供应披露窗口是否明确覆盖由接收方控制、被其控制或与其共同控制实体的员工，不得将其扁平化为接收方自身员工。原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“2.1.3 only to disclose the Confidential Information to employees of companies directly or indirectly owned or controlled by the Recipient, consultants and/or advisors to whom disclosure is necessary for the Permitted Purpose and then only on the understanding that such employees, consultants and/or advisors are expressly subject to the provisions of this Confidentiality Agreement.”"},{"choices":[{"meaning":"窗口明确覆盖承包商或独立承包商。","name":"stated"},{"meaning":"完整供应窗口没有明确覆盖承包商。","name":"not_stated_in_window"}],"examples":[],"name":"recipient_contractors_v2","question":"判断供应披露窗口是否明确覆盖承包商或独立承包商，不得由员工、顾问或代理人推断。原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“The Confidential Information may be disclosed only to employees or contractors of the Recipient with a “need to know” who are subject to written confidentiality agreements sufficient to carry out the intent of this Agreement.”"},{"choices":[{"meaning":"窗口明确覆盖顾问 consultants。","name":"stated"},{"meaning":"完整供应窗口没有明确覆盖 consultants。","name":"not_stated_in_window"}],"examples":[],"name":"recipient_consultants_v2","question":"判断供应披露窗口是否明确覆盖 consultants；不得由 contractors、agents 或 advisers 推断。原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“Auditor shall restrict disclosure of such Confidential Information to its employees and/or consultants with a need to know (and advise such employees and/or consultants of the obligations assumed herein), shall use the Confidential Information only for the purposes set forth in the Agreement, and shall not disclose such Confidential Information to any affiliates, subsidiaries, associates and/or third party without prior written approval of the Auditee.”"},{"choices":[{"meaning":"窗口明确覆盖代理人 agents。","name":"stated"},{"meaning":"完整供应窗口没有明确覆盖 agents。","name":"not_stated_in_window"}],"examples":[],"name":"recipient_agents_v2","question":"判断供应披露窗口是否明确覆盖 agents，不得由 representatives 或其他专业人员自动推断。原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“The Receiving Party shall take all practical steps to keep the Disclosing Pa