    return out","
"]},"operation_scopes":{"confidentiality_safeguard_v2":"window","destroy_material_scope_v1":"window","destroy_trigger_binding_v1":"window","disclosure_norm_effect_v2":"window","disclosure_recipient_owner_v2":"window","disclosure_recipient_roles_v2":"window","disposal_action_connection_v2":"window","extent_necessity_requirement_v2":"window","need_to_know_requirement_v2":"window","positive_disclosure_locator_v2":"window","positive_disposal_locator_v2":"window","post_disposal_retention_effect_v2":"window","return_material_scope_v1":"window","return_trigger_binding_v1":"window"},"operations":[{"choices":[{"meaning":"完整当前来源中存在至少一个实际生效的内部人员或专业服务接收者披露规范，证据标出其候选窗口。","name":"candidate_found"},{"meaning":"检查全部当前来源单元后，没有发现实际生效的内部人员或专业服务接收者披露规范。","name":"none_in_complete_source"}],"examples":[{"choice":"candidate_found","quote":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v250"},"source":"ContractNLI:78adf3b331962862d6b5becfd6a3eaec7314b1005fc21198f53282c69411f583"}],"name":"positive_disclosure_locator_v2","question":"检查完整当前来源，找出实际生效的内部人员或专业服务接收者披露规范，包括直接许可和披露禁止中的明示类别许可例外。定义、序言、人员信息描述、逐案书面授权和处置条款不是候选。candidate_found 的证据应覆盖全部候选窗口；只有检查全部当前来源仍无候选时才选择 none_in_complete_source。原始 TRAIN 正例（逐字）：“The Confidential Information may be disclosed only to employees or contractors of the Recipient with a “need to know” who are subject to written confidentiality agreements sufficient to carry out the intent of this Agreement.”"},{"choices":[{"meaning":"窗口明示实际生效的类别化披露许可。","name":"operative_permission"},{"meaning":"窗口给出披露禁止，同时对列明接收者类别形成真实许可例外。","name":"prohibition_with_class_permission"},{"meaning":"窗口只有实际披露禁止，没有列明接收者类别许可。","name":"operative_prohibition_only"},{"meaning":"窗口把人员类别置于保密义务范围，但省略足以形成清晰披露许可的语言。","name":"elliptical_recipient_confidentiality_scope"},{"meaning":"窗口不形成实际披露规范。","name":"not_an_operative_disclosure_norm"}],"examples":[{"choice":"operative_permission","quote":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v250"},"source":"ContractNLI:78adf3b331962862d6b5becfd6a3eaec7314b1005fc21198f53282c69411f583"},{"choice":"prohibition_with_class_permission","quote":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v230"},"source":"ContractNLI:d9360f2a8c03efc35524289167a83e9505ebae476367505b868af29f37fcffa0"},{"choice":"elliptical_recipient_confidentiality_scope","quote":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v251"},"source":"ContractNLI:8fb38aee9252512c6e77c4fa76440766310d1a4090d0149bff12ebf69ec972e7"}],"name":"disclosure_norm_effect_v2","question":"判断整个供应窗口的披露规范效力。只按来源实际措辞分类；不得把序言、定义、人员信息描述或省略文字补成许可。一般禁止中对列明接收者类别的真实例外属于 prohibition_with_class_permission。原始 TRAIN 直接许可（逐字）：“The Confidential Information may be disclosed only to employees or contractors of the Recipient with a “need to know” who are subject to written confidentiality agreements sufficient to carry out the intent of this Agreement.” 原始 TRAIN 类别例外（逐字）：“(c) not to disclose the same whether to its employees or to third parties except in confidence to such of its employees, directors or contractors who need to know the same for the Purpose and that (i) such employees, directors and contractors are obliged by their contracts of employment or services not to disclose the same, (ii) the receiving party shall enforce such obligations at its expense and at the request of the disclosing party in so far as breach thereof relates to the disclosing party's Confidential Information;” 原始 TRAIN 椭圆表述（逐字）：“The obligations of the Parties shall be to hold and maintain the Confidential Information in the strictest of confidence at all times and to their agents, employees, representatives, affiliates, and any other individual or entity that is on a “need to know” basis.”"},{"choices":[{"meaning":"许可只明确列出员工、工作人员或内部人员。","name":"employees_only"},{"meaning":"许可明确列出员工和承包商。","name":"employees_and_contractors"},{"meaning":"许可明确列出员工以及顾问或顾问类专业人员。","name":"employees_and_consultants_or_advisers"},{"meaning":"许可明确列出员工以及代理人。","name":"employees_and_agents"},{"meaning":"许可列出员工并列出两种以上承包、顾问、代理或专业服务角色。","name":"employees_and_multiple_professionals"},{"meaning":"许可列出承包、顾问、代理或专业服务角色，但未列出员工。","name":"professionals_without_employees"},{"meaning":"许可使用 Representatives，且其具体成员须由当前来源中的匹配定义解释。","name":"representatives_by_definition"},{"meaning":"窗口形成许可，但明确角色组合不属于以上有限类别；逐字证据限定其范围。","name":"other_explicit_role_set"},{"meaning":"供应窗口没有明确给出内部人员或专业服务接收者角色。","name":"no_recipient_roles_stated"}],"examples":[{"choice":"employees_and_contractors","quote":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v250"},"source":"ContractNLI:78adf3b331962862d6b5becfd6a3eaec7314b1005fc21198f53282c69411f583"},{"choice":"employees_and_consultants_or_advisers","quote":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v252"},"source":"ContractNLI:4607c94ccc67dee14eeed59b1e3fb9149bda4c8ddd1601bba8017bcbd5fca9d3"}],"name":"disclosure_recipient_roles_v2","question":"分类供应披露窗口明确列出的接收者角色。员工、承包商、顾问、专业顾问和代理人不得相互替代；本操作只读角色组合，不决定其所有者。原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“The Confidential Information may be disclosed only to employees or contractors of the Recipient with a “need to know” who are subject to written confidentiality agreements sufficient to carry out the intent of this Agreement.” 原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“2.1.3 only to disclose the Confidential Information to employees of companies directly or indirectly owned or controlled by the Recipient, consultants and/or advisors to whom disclosure is necessary for the Permitted Purpose and then only on the understanding that such employees, consultants and/or advisors are expressly subject to the provisions of this Confidentiality Agreement.”"},{"choices":[{"meaning":"所列角色均属于或服务于接收方本身。","name":"recipient_owned_all"},{"meaning":"所列角色均属于或服务于接收方控制、被控制或共同控制的实体。","name":"controlled_entity_owned_all"},{"meaning":"员工属于受控实体，而顾问或专业人员直接服务于接收方。","name":"controlled_employees_recipient_professionals"},{"meaning":"来源分别把相同或相近角色列为接收方自身人员和受控实体人员。","name":"recipient_and_controlled_same_roles"},{"meaning":"来源给出其他明确的混合所有权绑定，须由逐字证据限定。","name":"other_mixed_owner_binding"},{"meaning":"供应窗口没有清楚给出人员角色的所有者。","name":"owner_not_stated_in_window"}],"examples":[{"choice":"recipient_owned_all","quote":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v250"},"source":"ContractNLI:78adf3b331962862d6b5becfd6a3eaec7314b1005fc21198f53282c69411f583"},{"choice":"controlled_employees_recipient_professionals","quote":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v252"},"source":"ContractNLI:4607c94ccc67dee14eeed59b1e3fb9149bda4c8ddd1601bba8017bcbd5fca9d3"}],"name":"disclosure_recipient_owner_v2","question":"独立判断供应许可中人员角色的所有者。保持接收方自身人员、受其控制实体人员及二者混合的区别；不要用角色名称推断所有权。原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“The Confidential Information may be disclosed only to employees or contractors of the Recipient with a “need to know” who are subject to written confidentiality agreements sufficient to carry out the intent of this Agreement.” 原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“2.1.3 only to disclose the Confidential Information to employees of companies directly or indirectly owned or controlled by the Recipient, consultants and/or advisors to whom disclosure is necessary for the Permitted Purpose and then only on the understanding that such employees, consultants and/or advisors are expressly subject to the provisions of this Confidentiality Agreement.”"},{"choices":[{"meaning":"窗口明示接收者须具有 need-to-know。","name":"need_to_know_required"},{"meaning":"完整供应窗口没有陈述 need-to-know 条件。","name":"need_to_know_not_stated_in_window"}],"examples":[{"choice":"need_to_know_required","quote":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v250"},"source":"ContractNLI:78adf3b331962862d6b5becfd6a3eaec7314b1005fc21198f53282c69411f583"}],"name":"need_to_know_requirement_v2","question":"判断供应披露窗口是否明示接收者必须具有 need-to-know；不得从必要目的或一般保密义务推断。原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“The Confidential Information may be disclosed only to employees or contractors of the Recipient with a “need to know” who are subject to written confidentiality agreements sufficient to carry out the intent of this Agreement.”"},{"choices":[{"meaning":"窗口要求接收者受书面保密协议或书面约束。","name":"written_confidentiality_required"},{"meaning":"窗口要求接收者受保密义务约束，但没有要求另行书面协议。","name":"confidentiality_required_without_separate_written_agreement"},{"meaning":"完整供应窗口没有陈述接收者保密保障。","name":"no_safeguard_stated_in_window"}],"examples":[{"choice":"written_confidentiality_required","quote":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v250"},"source":"ContractNLI:78adf3b331962862d6b5becfd6a3eaec7314b1005fc21198f53282c69411f583"},{"choice":"confidentiality_required_without_separate_written_agreement","quote":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v252"},"source":"ContractNLI:4607c94ccc67dee14eeed59b1e3fb9149bda4c8ddd1601bba8017bcbd5fca9d3"}],"name":"confidentiality_safeguard_v2","question":"判断供应披露窗口对接收者规定的保密保障，区分书面协议、未另行要求书面形式的保密义务和未陈述保障。原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“The Confidential Information may be disclosed only to employees or contractors of the Recipient with a “need to know” who are subject to written confidentiality agreements sufficient to carry out the intent of this Agreement.” 原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“2.1.3 only to disclose the Confidential Information to employees of companies directly or indirectly owned or controlled by the Recipient, consultants and/or advisors to whom disclosure is necessary for the Permitted Purpose and then only on the understanding that such employees, consultants and/or advisors are expressly subject to the provisions of this Confidentiality Agreement.”"},{"choices":[{"meaning":"窗口明示披露、访问或知识范围限于所述目的所必需的程度。","name":"extent_necessary_required"},{"meaning":"完整供应窗口没有陈述必要程度限制。","name":"extent_limit_not_stated_in_window"}],"examples":[{"choice":"extent_necessary_required","quote":"The Receiving Party will disclose information it receives from SINTEC only to selected members of its staff and only to the extent absolutely necessary for SINTEC's specified or authorized purposes in each case.","source":"ContractNLI:5cad3f377b9be1bb3405ca63053a7fc38e690444ec13d9f8a52884246b4f84ad"}],"name":"extent_necessity_requirement_v2","question":"判断供应披露窗口是否把披露、访问或接收者知识限制在为所述目的所必要的范围。不得从 need-to-know 或保密义务推断。原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“The Receiving Party will disclose information it receives from SINTEC only to selected members of its staff and only to the extent absolutely necessary for SINTEC's specified or authorized purposes in each case.”"},{"choices":[{"meaning":"完整当前来源中存在至少一个实际返还、销毁、删除或永久擦除义务，证据标出其候选窗口。","name":"candidate_found"},{"meaning":"检查全部当前来源单元后，没有发现实际返还、销毁、删除或永久擦除义务。","name":"none_in_complete_source"}],"examples":[{"choice":"candidate_found","quote":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v253"},"source":"ContractNLI:8fb38aee9252512c6e77c4fa76440766310d1a4090d0149bff12ebf69ec972e7"}],"name":"positive_disposal_locator_v2","question":"检查完整当前来源，找出所有实际返还、销毁、删除或永久擦除受保护信息、副本或相关材料的义务。证据应覆盖动作、材料、触发及紧邻资格；仅有终止、存续、定义或不得保留文字不是处置义务。只有检查全部当前来源仍无义务时才选择 none_in_complete_source。原始 TRAIN 正例（逐字）：“If requested, either Party shall be bound to return any and all materials to the Requesting Party within ____ days.”"},{"choices":[{"meaning":"窗口要求返还而未要求销毁。","name":"return_only"},{"meaning":"窗口要求销毁、删除或擦除而未要求返还。","name":"destroy_only"},{"meaning":"窗口允许以返还或销毁二选一履行。","name":"return_or_destroy_alternative"},{"meaning":"返还是通常动作，销毁仅在来源所述授权下替代返还。","name":"return_or_authorized_destroy"},{"meaning":"窗口要求返还与销毁同时适用于各自明示的材料范围。","name":"return_and_destroy_distinct_scopes"},{"meaning":"供应窗口没有实际返还、销毁、删除或擦除动作。","name":"not_a_disposal_action"}],"examples":[{"choice":"return_or_authorized_destroy","quote":"2.1.7 upon demand of the OSCE, to promptly return all Confidential Information (in whatever medium), together with all copies thereof or, where expressly authorised in writing by the OSCE, to destroy or delete all such Confidential Information and shall confirm to the OSCE in writing that such destruction or deletion has taken place.","source":"ContractNLI:4607c94ccc67dee14eeed59b1e3fb9149bda4c8ddd1601bba8017bcbd5fca9d3"},{"choice":"return_and_destroy_distinct_scopes","quote":"5.2.1 return all Confidential Information including copies to the disclosing Party; and 5.2.2 destroy or permanently erase all copies made by the receiving Party and procure that anyone to whom the receiving Party has supplied copies destroys or permanently erases such copies and any further copies made by them.","source":"ContractNLI:e82b951aca3540fe6be6bfa63cae714cb7c7d55f38631402a3b6521eb6fc9bc6"}],"name":"disposal_action_connection_v2","question":"判断供应处置窗口中返还与销毁动作的连接。区分任选、需授权才可替代以及针对各自材料同时履行。原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“2.1.7 upon demand of the OSCE, to promptly return all Confidential Information (in whatever medium), together with all copies thereof or, where expressly authorised in writing by the OSCE, to destroy or delete all such Confidential Information and shall confirm to the OSCE in writing that such destruction or deletion has taken place.” 原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“5.2.1 return all Confidential Information including copies to the disclosing Party; and 5.2.2 destroy or permanently erase all copies made by the receiving Party and procure that anyone to whom the receiving Party has supplied copies destroys or permanently erases such copies and any further copies made by them.”"},{"choices":[{"meaning":"窗口没有返还动作。","name":"action_not_present"},{"meaning":"返还仅由请求或要求触发。","name":"request_only"},{"meaning":"返还仅由协议终止或到期触发。","name":"agreement_termination_only"},{"meaning":"返还仅由业务或工作关系终止或到期触发。","name":"relationship_termination_only"},{"meaning":"返还仅由项目终止或到期触发。","name":"project_termination_only"},{"meaning":"返还仅由人员服务终止触发。","name":"service_termination_only"},{"meaning":"返还仅由规定期限内未建立预期关系触发。","name":"relationship_nonformation_only"},{"meaning":"协议终止或到期与请求均可触发返还。","name":"agreement_termination_or_request"},{"meaning":"关系终止与请求均可触发返还。","name":"relationship_termination_or_request"},{"meaning":"关系未建立期限与请求均可触发返还。","name":"relationship_nonformation_or_request"},{"meaning":"返还有其他明示触发，须由逐字证据保留。","name":"other_explicit_trigger"},{"meaning":"窗口含返还动作，但没有陈述其触发。","name":"no_trigger_stated_in_window"}],"examples":[{"choice":"request_only","quote":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v254"},"source":"ContractNLI:6fce84641005b157aa8eda07d8372f5b6fd5f0f893665acfbfc3e8fdeda3597e"},{"choice":"relationship_termination_only","quote":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v255"},"source":"ContractNLI:5cad3f377b9be1bb3405ca63053a7fc38e690444ec13d9f8a52884246b4f84ad"}],"name":"return_trigger_binding_v1","question":"只判断供应窗口中返还动作的实际触发；不得把销毁动作的触发复制给返还。原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“Each party agrees that all Confidential Information of the other party, including any copies thereof, shall be returned to the disclosing party upon request or destroyed within ten (10) business days of the expiration or other termination of the Project.” 原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“5.3 The Receiving Party shall return to SINTEC any and all information disclosed by SINTEC as well as any copies thereof automatically upon termination/expiration of the business relation- ship.”"},{"choices":[{"meaning":"窗口没有销毁、删除或擦除动作。","name":"action_not_present"},{"meaning":"销毁仅由请求或要求触发。","name":"request_only"},{"meaning":"销毁仅由协议终止或到期触发。","name":"agreement_termination_only"},{"meaning":"销毁仅由业务或工作关系终止或到期触发。","name":"relationship_termination_only"},{"meaning":"销毁仅由项目终止或到期触发。","name":"project_termination_only"},{"meaning":"销毁仅由人员服务终止触发。","name":"service_termination_only"},{"meaning":"销毁仅由规定期限内未建立预期关系触发。","name":"relationship_nonformation_only"},{"meaning":"协议终止或到期与请求均可触发销毁。","name":"agreement_termination_or_request"},{"meaning":"关系终止与请求均可触发销毁。","name":"relationship_termination_or_request"},{"meaning":"关系未建立期限与请求均可触发销毁。","name":"relationship_nonformation_or_request"},{"meaning":"销毁有其他明示触发，须由逐字证据保留。","name":"other_explicit_trigger"},{"meaning":"窗口含销毁动作，但没有陈述其触发。","name":"no_trigger_stated_in_window"}],"examples":[{"choice":"project_termination_only","quote":{"__lsg_shared_value__":"v254"},"source":"ContractNLI:6fce84641005b157aa8eda07d8372f5b6fd5f0f893665acfbfc3e8fdeda3597e"}],"name":"destroy_trigger_binding_v1","question":"只判断供应窗口中销毁、删除或擦除动作的实际触发；不得把返还动作的触发复制给销毁。原始 TRAIN（逐字）：“Each party agrees that all Confidential Information of the other party, including any copies thereof, shall be returned to the disclosing party upon request or destroyed within ten (10) business days of the expiration or other termination of the Project.”"},{"choices":[{"meaning":"窗口没有返还动作。","name":"action_not_present"},{"meaning":"返还仅明示覆盖受保护信息本身。","name":"confidential_information_only"},{"meaning":"返还明示覆盖受保护信息及其副本。","name":"confi